      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Who we are",
        "heading": "Independent, local and passionate about the home",
        "body": "<p>We opened our doors with a simple idea: buying appliances should be easy, honest and friendly. Today we're still a real shop, with real people who test the products we sell and are always happy to help.</p><p>From a first air fryer to a full outdoor kitchen, come and see the range in person - or reserve online and collect when it suits you.</p>",
        "heading_size": "h3",
        "signature": "The team",
        "signature_role": "Your local store",
        "layout": "image-right",
        "button_label": "Visit the store",
        "button_link": "/pages/find-a-store",
        "button_style": "m-button--primary",
        "color_scheme": "default",
        "container": "container",
        "padding_top": 72,
        "padding_bottom": 72,
        "animations": "inherit"
      }
